{"4222850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "pipedog", "steam_appid": 4222850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/0aaf6a70918186653f5a6895650fc3b7.poster.avif?t=1787011240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/0aaf6a70918186653f5a6895650fc3b7.webm?t=1787011240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/0aaf6a70918186653f5a6895650fc3b7.mp4?t=1787011240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a dog, far from home. The world around you brims with ancient structures, broken systems, and strange creatures. Climb through the shifting environments decaying a civilization as you document the critters of the world and uncover its secrets. Join your friends, find a pack, and stick together; but be careful not to lose sight of each other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/7ca36407faf7709ea9f814fe4ddf6323.poster.avif?t=1787011240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/7ca36407faf7709ea9f814fe4ddf6323.webm?t=1787011240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/7ca36407faf7709ea9f814fe4ddf6323.mp4?t=1787011240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re never alone in the machine. Interact with other dogs along your journey and work together to scout, spot, and explore. When one wrong step can have severe consequences, your pack is your lifeline in a world that can’t understand you. Featuring stunning visuals and a completely original soundtrack, <i>pipedog</i> delivers an MMO experience like no other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an infinite procedurally generated pipe world, and find mysterious structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the world with your dog-based platforming abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends to join you on your journey, or join up with other dogs you meet and form a pack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to document the world, and explore varying biomes to discover new critters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new patterns, colors, and gear to show off your unique dog-style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/0aaf6a70918186653f5a6895650fc3b7.poster.avif?t=1787011240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/0aaf6a70918186653f5a6895650fc3b7.webm?t=1787011240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/0aaf6a70918186653f5a6895650fc3b7.mp4?t=1787011240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a dog, far from home. The world around you brims with ancient structures, broken systems, and strange creatures. Climb through the shifting environments decaying a civilization as you document the critters of the world and uncover its secrets. Join your friends, find a pack, and stick together; but be careful not to lose sight of each other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/7ca36407faf7709ea9f814fe4ddf6323.poster.avif?t=1787011240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/7ca36407faf7709ea9f814fe4ddf6323.webm?t=1787011240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222850/extras/7ca36407faf7709ea9f814fe4ddf6323.mp4?t=1787011240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re never alone in the machine. Interact with other dogs along your journey and work together to scout, spot, and explore. When one wrong step can have severe consequences, your pack is your lifeline in a world that can’t understand you. Featuring stunning visuals and a completely original soundtrack, <i>pipedog</i> delivers an MMO experience like no other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an infinite procedurally generated pipe world, and find mysterious structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the world with your dog-based platforming abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends to join you on your journey, or join up with other dogs you meet and form a pack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to document the world, and explore varying biomes to discover new critters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new patterns, colors, and gear to show off your unique dog-style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are a dog, lost in an infinite pipe world. Find your pack, meet strange creatures, and navigate a bizarre world as an outsider searching for a home.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong